# Annotated example of one entry of the terminological concept set.
# The final entry shape is the glossarist dataset schema; this file
# records the intended content, not yet the validated encoding.
term: digital product passport
definition: >-
  Legal materialized view of a governed digital twin, computed under
  a profile from the testimonial record, issued where the legal duty
  attaches.
grammar_info:
  - {"graphic": "n", "preposition": "", "participle": ""}
domain_scoped: false          # structural term: definable globally
relations:
  - type: broader             # generic relation (hypernym)
    target: projection
  - type: has_part            # partitive relation
    target: profile
  - type: associative
    target: digital twin
    note: the passport projects the twin; the twin never projects the passport
sources:
  - ISO 93333 clause 3
notes:
  - Carried on the carrier as a Tier-A payload or served as a view;
    never a static document.
